# Angel of Finality: "When this creature enters, exile target player's graveyard" (CR 115.1, 406.2). Bot1's Black Lotus is in its own
# graveyard (sacrificed for mana on turn 1) and Bot2's Lightning Bolt is in theirs. Bot1 targets Bot2, so the Bolt is exiled and the
# Lotus stays (a positive control that only the chosen graveyard is exiled). The Angel is a 3/4 flier. The trigger waits on the
# stack until its controller passes with the Angel on the battlefield, with both graveyards still full.

